          "tz": 0
        },
        "subject": "LU-20861 llite: stop logging s_count in ll_umount_begin()",
        "message": "LU-20861 llite: stop logging s_count in ll_umount_begin()\n\nLinux commit v7.2-rc1-7-g3ec9800c2d33 (\"super: convert s_count to\nrefcount_t s_passive\") renamed superblock field s_count to s_passive\nand changed its type to refcount_t, breaking the s_count reference in\nll_umount_begin().\n\nRemove the passive reference count from the D_VFSTRACE message to\navoid compatibility code for diagnostic output. Continue logging\ns_active.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:Opus-5.5\nSigned-off-by: Chell Laszlo <pumpkinbiscuit@proton.me>\nChange-Id: I1d8307bbd38dd8a2b86cc7fe2c78e4fcf48e7f90\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/69441\nReviewed-by: James Simmons <jsimmons@infradead.org>\nReviewed-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
